Usage: slurm-notify email test --profile <absolute-path>
       slurm-notify email --help

Send one experimental synthetic email through SendGrid, Mailgun or Gmail API.
Requires a protected profile and explicit credential references. No scheduler,
state, token refresh, automatic retries or foreground email-API monitoring.
Gmail requires an unexpired access token and verified account identity.
API acceptance does not establish inbox delivery or human receipt.
